<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-1953] PortableContext: rework ID mappers handling.</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-1953</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;1) BasicClassIdMapper.typeId do not perform to-lower-case conversion.&lt;br/&gt;
2) BasicClassIdMapper appears to behave in absolutely the same way as IdMapperWrapper(null). Then why do we have two constants DFLT_ID_MAPPER and BASIC_CLS_ID_MAPPER?&lt;br/&gt;
3) We can slightly improve perofrmance introducing internal ID mapper with two implementations - default (lower case hash code) and delegating (will user-supplied mapper). This way we will reduce amount of virtual calls in the most common case.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
